msgctxt "22_12P01"
msgid "Change my mind."
msgstr "Jag har ändrat mig."

msgctxt "23_01N01"
msgid "I know the prayer of insight."
msgstr "Jag känner till insiktens bön."

msgctxt "23_01N02"
msgid "When I have learned it, then you may know."
msgstr "När jag har lärt mig den får ni veta."

msgctxt "23_01N03"
msgid "He who seeks truth has been here four times as long as I."
msgstr "Den som söker sanningen har varit här fyra gånger så länge som jag."

msgctxt "23_01N04"
msgid "Perhaps I'll talk to you later, if I may."
msgstr "Kanske talar jag med er senare, om jag får."

msgctxt "23_01P01"
msgid "What is the prayer you have learned?"
msgstr "Vilken bön har ni lärt er?"

msgctxt "23_01P02"
msgid "What is the prayer you study?"
msgstr "Vilken bön studerar ni?"

msgctxt "23_01P03"
msgid "Have you studied long?"
msgstr "Har ni studerat länge?"

msgctxt "24_01N01"
msgid "I know the prayer of wisdom."
msgstr "Jag känner till visdomens bön."

msgctxt "24_01N02"
msgid "When I have learned it, then you may know."
msgstr "När jag har lärt mig den får ni veta."

msgctxt "24_01N03"
msgid "He who has found truth has been here four times as long as I."
msgstr ""
"Den som har funnit sanningen har varit här fyra gånger så länge som jag."

msgctxt "24_01N04"
msgid "Perhaps I'll talk to you later, if I may."
msgstr "Kanske talar jag med er senare, om jag får."

msgctxt "24_01P01"
msgid "What is the prayer you have learned?"
msgstr "Vilken bön har ni lärt er?"

msgctxt "24_01P02"
msgid "What is the prayer you study?"
msgstr "Vilken bön studerar ni?"

msgctxt "24_01P03"
msgid "Have you studied long?"
msgstr "Har ni studerat länge?"

msgctxt "25_01N01"
msgid "I know the prayer of truth."
msgstr "Jag känner till sanningens bön."

msgctxt "25_01N02"
msgid "When I have learned it, then you may know."
msgstr "När jag har lärt mig den får ni veta."

msgctxt "25_01N03"
msgid "I have studied twice as long as he who seeks insight."
msgstr "Jag har studerat dubbelt så länge som den som söker insikt."

msgctxt "25_01N04"
msgid "Perhaps I'll talk to you later, if I may."
msgstr "Kanske talar jag med er senare, om jag får."

msgctxt "25_01P01"
msgid "What is the prayer you have learned?"
msgstr "Vilken bön har ni lärt er?"

msgctxt "25_01P02"
msgid "What is the prayer you study?"
msgstr "Vilken bön studerar ni?"

msgctxt "25_01P03"
msgid "Have you studied long?"
msgstr "Har ni studerat länge?"

msgctxt "26_01N01"
msgid "I know the prayer of peace."
msgstr "Jag känner till fridens bön."

msgctxt "26_01N02"
msgid "When I have learned it, then you may know."
msgstr "När jag har lärt mig den får ni veta."

msgctxt "26_01N03"
msgid ""
"I have studied twice as long as he who seeks serenity, and three times as "
"long as he who seeks wisdom."
msgstr ""
"Jag har studerat dubbelt så länge som den som söker stillhet och tre gånger "
"så länge som den som söker visdom."

msgctxt "26_01N04"
msgid "Perhaps I'll talk to you later, if I may."
msgstr "Kanske talar jag med er senare, om jag får."

msgctxt "26_01P01"
msgid "What is the prayer you have learned?"
msgstr "Vilken bön har ni lärt er?"

msgctxt "26_01P02"
msgid "What is the prayer you study?"
msgstr "Vilken bön studerar ni?"

msgctxt "26_01P03"
msgid "Have you studied long?"
msgstr "Har ni studerat länge?"

msgctxt "27_01N01"
msgid "(Chinese)"
msgstr "(Kinesiska)"

msgctxt "27_01N02"
msgid "(Chinese)"
msgstr "(Kinesiska)"

msgctxt "27_01N03"
msgid "(Chinese)"
msgstr "(Kinesiska)"

msgctxt "27_01P01"
msgid "May, ask him about the broken pottery."
msgstr "Mei, fråga honom om det trasiga krukgodset."

msgctxt "27_01P02"
msgid "Ask him about the hand sticking from the wall down there."
msgstr "Fråga honom om handen som sticker ut ur väggen där nere."

msgctxt "27_01P03"
msgid "Ask him if he has a lantern or something."
msgstr "Fråga honom om han har en lykta eller något."

msgctxt "27_01P04"
msgid "Perhaps I'll talk to him later."
msgstr "Kanske talar jag med honom senare."

msgctxt "27_02N01"
msgid "(Chinese)"
msgstr "(Kinesiska)"

msgctxt "27_02N02"
msgid "It came from his root cellar."
msgstr "Den kom från hans rotkällare."

msgctxt "27_03N01"
msgid "(Chinese)"
msgstr "(Kinesiska)"

msgctxt "27_04N01"
msgid "(Chinese)"
msgstr "(Kinesiska)"

msgctxt "27_04N02"
msgid ""
"He says he was afraid to touch the hand because he was afraid the dirt wall "
"might collapse."
msgstr ""
"Han säger att han var rädd för att röra handen eftersom han var rädd att "
"jordväggen kunde rasa."

msgctxt "27_05P01"
msgid "Was he? I wonder if his fear is justified."
msgstr "Var han det? Jag undrar om hans rädsla är befogad."

msgctxt "27_06P01"
msgid "Luckily for us, he was right."
msgstr "Lyckligtvis för oss hade han rätt."

msgctxt "28_01N01"
msgid "I-I can't hold it!"
msgstr "J-jag kan inte hålla den!"

msgctxt "28_01N02"
msgid "How will you get past? No, I'm not leaving you behind."
msgstr "Hur ska du komma förbi? Nej, jag lämnar dig inte kvar."

msgctxt "28_01P01"
msgid "May, hold this crank while I try to slip past the stone block."
msgstr "Mei, håll den här veven medan jag försöker ta mig förbi stenblocket."

msgctxt "28_01P02"
msgid "May, I'll hold the crank while you slip past the stone block."
msgstr "Mei, jag håller veven medan du tar dig förbi stenblocket."

msgctxt "28_01P03"
msgid "We'll have to be clever about this."
msgstr "Vi måste vara smarta här."

msgctxt "28_02N01"
msgid "Robert!"
msgstr "Robert!"

msgctxt "29_01N01"
msgid "What will you do?"
msgstr "Vad ska du göra?"
